{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection\/Kind-swift.struct","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection\/Kind-swift.struct\/Content-swift.enum"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A principal or secondary voice symbol."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldirection\/kind-swift.struct\/content-swift.enum\/principalvoice(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLDirectionV4KindV7ContentO14principalVoiceyAgA012MXLPrincipalG0VcAGmF","title":"MXLDirection.Kind.Content.principalVoice(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"principalVoice","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPrincipalVoice","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLPrincipalVoiceV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Case","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection\/Kind-swift.struct\/Content-swift.enum\/principalVoice(_:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"principalVoice","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPrincipalVoice","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrincipalVoice","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL17MXLPrincipalVoiceV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDirection/Kind-swift.struct":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection\/Kind-swift.struct","title":"MXLDirection.Kind","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Textual direction types may have more than 1 component due to multiple fonts. The dynamics element may also be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"used in the notations element. Attribute groups related to print suggestions apply to the individual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"direction-type, not to the overall direction.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldirection\/kind-swift.struct"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDirection":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDirection"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection","title":"MXLDirection","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDirection"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A direction is a musical indication that is not necessarily attached to a specific note. Two or more may be","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"combined to indicate words followed by the start of a dashed line, the end of a wedge followed by dynamics,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"etc. For applications where a specific direction is indeed attached to a specific note, the direction element","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"can be associated with the first note element that follows it in score order that is not in a different voice.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldirection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDirection/Kind-swift.struct/Content-swift.enum":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDirection\/Kind-swift.struct\/Content-swift.enum","title":"MXLDirection.Kind.Content","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Content","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One of the alternatives for DirectionType."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldirection\/kind-swift.struct\/content-swift.enum"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPrincipalVoice":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLPrincipalVoice","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlprincipalvoice","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The principal-voice type represents principal and secondary voices in a score, either for analysis or for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"square bracket symbols that appear in a score. The element content is used for analysis and may be any text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value. The symbol attribute indicates the type of symbol used. When used for analysis separate from any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"printed score markings, it should be set to none. Otherwise if the type is stop it should be set to plain."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPrincipalVoice"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrincipalVoice","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPrincipalVoice"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDirection/Kind-swift.struct/Content-swift.enum/principalVoice(_:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldirection\/kind-swift.struct\/content-swift.enum\/principalvoice(_:)","title":"MXLDirection.Kind.Content.principalVoice(_:)","fragments":[{"text"